*==============================================================
*  RBMK-1000 3D CORE MODEL with DLIB_99-derived 2-group XS
*  Realistic geometry: 49x49x28, 25 cm pitch, 1661 fuel channels
*==============================================================
LINKED_LIST RBMK RBMK_2 MACRO MACRO2 TRACK SYSTEM FLUX MATEX ;
MODULE GEO: MAC: TRIVAT: TRIVAA: FLUD: USPLIT: MACINI: GREP: END: ;
REAL Keff ;
PROCEDURE assertS ;

